    <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="title" content="Is it required for Serbian vending machines to be certified?">
        <meta name="description" content="Based on the current fiscalization model in Serbia, vending machines are considered a specific type of cash register software (ESIR) as one of the four existing types of ESIR based on the official classification. Vending machines in Serbia also require certification in order for taxpayers to use them in their stores, just like with any other kind of ESIR.">

